// TinvestReconcileMismatchKind What kind of difference the check found. `instrument`: a security's quantity differs, or the journal holds one the broker does not — usually operations that did not become journal entries (see the unparsed list). `currency`: a cash balance differs. `unknown_security`: the broker holds a security no journal entry ever named, labelled with the broker's own naming — usually a corporate action that arrived as no operation. `unsupported`: an asset of a kind this program does not account for (a future, an option).
